       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BANK-DEMO-V1.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-ACCOUNT-BALANCE    PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 5000.00.
       01 WS-WITHDRAW-AMOUNT    PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 1200.00.
       01 WS-STATUS-CODE        PIC X(04)   VALUE "INIT".
       01 WS-AUDIT-FLAG         PIC 9(01)   VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VALIDATE-REQUEST.
           IF WS-STATUS-CODE = "OKAY"
               PERFORM 2000-PROCESS-WITHDRAWAL
               PERFORM 3000-AUDIT-TRANSACTION
           ELSE
               PERFORM 4000-HANDLE-REJECTION
           END-IF.
           STOP RUN.

       1000-VALIDATE-REQUEST.
           IF WS-WITHDRAW-AMOUNT <= WS-ACCOUNT-BALANCE
               MOVE "OKAY" TO WS-STATUS-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE "FAIL" TO WS-STATUS-CODE
           END-IF.

       2000-PROCESS-WITHDRAWAL.
           SUBTRACT WS-WITHDRAW-AMOUNT FROM WS-ACCOUNT-BALANCE.
           MOVE "DONE" TO WS-STATUS-CODE.

       3000-AUDIT-TRANSACTION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-AUDIT-FLAG.

       4000-HANDLE-REJECTION.
           MOVE 9 TO WS-AUDIT-FLAG.
